### Locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/ref/location?Page=1&Limit=50
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Locations (deprecated only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ref/location?Deprecated=true
api-auth-accountid: {{accountId}}
api-auth-applicationkey: {{applicationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

